# Finance UI rules

Read `.cursor/skills/techhind-finance-delivery-qa/reference/design.md` and `docs/design-guidelines.json`.

- Maximize data density; minimize padding/spacing
- Use existing Layout, shadcn/Radix, and page patterns
- INR Indian grouping; mono for GSTIN / invoice nos / HSN
- Required interactive controls need kebab-case `data-testid`
- Solid modal/drawer backgrounds — no transparent sheets
